'''Shadow''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that can be obtained from the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Sonic the Hedgehog Collaboration Event]]. He was added in [[Version 14.4 Update|Version 14.4]] for [[Nyanko Daisensou|BJCP]] and [[Version 14.5 Update|Version 14.5]] for [[The Battle Cats|BCEN]].

